<cl=F0F010>Guide:<cl=00FF00> Greetings, wanderer from Earth. I was left here by the Weaver to help those who came to our world for the first time. You are trapped in the dungeons of the royal castle, which is located on top of the world, but you have to go down to the Hyperion mainland.<br><br>

<cl=FFFFFF>Use "W" and "S" to move back and forth.<br>
To move left and right, use "A" and "D".<br>
Move the mouse left and right to rotate.<br>
Use the right mouse button to turn the cursor on/off.<br><br>
<l="hts:\\language\i_mainp.hts">Learn more...<\l><br>
<l="hts:\\language\helpindex.hts">Full help for the game (F1)<\l><br>
}